-Date: Wed, 23 Oct 2024 17:12:39 +0300
-Subject: [PATCH] wifi: rtw88: Move pwr_track_tbl to struct rtw_rfe_def
-
-RTL8812AU uses one set of TX power tracking tables for RFE 3, and
-another set for everything else.
